---
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 px-6 sm:px-12 lg:px-16 border-b-3 border-[#0A0F14] bg-[#F3F1EB] relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-20">
    
    <!-- 01. Strong Opening Statement & Identity -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-start">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
        <h2 class="font-heading font-black text-4xl sm:text-6xl uppercase leading-tight tracking-tight text-[#0A0F14]">
          I'M INTERESTED IN WHAT HAPPENS WHEN TECHNOLOGY LEAVES THE SCREEN AND STARTS DOING SOMETHING USEFUL.
        </h2>
        <p class="font-sans text-base sm:text-lg text-[#0A0F14]/80 leading-relaxed">
          I am a BCA student, technologist, and builder in Bengaluru. I don't build software just for the sake of code — I build systems to solve real friction, empower communities, and test ideas.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 02. Right Column: The Way I Think & Current Status -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-8">
        <!-- The Way I Think (Brutalist Pill) -->
        <div class="bg-[#FFD83D] p-8 brutal-border-thick brutal-shadow-xl space-y-4">
          <div class="font-mono-tech text-xs font-bold text-[#0A0F14] uppercase tracking-widest">
            ★ THE WAY I THINK
          </div>
          <div class="font-heading font-black text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[#0A0F14] uppercase leading-none">
            BUILD → BREAK → LEARN → BUILD BETTER
          </div>
          <p class="font-mono-tech text-sm text-[#0A0F14] leading-relaxed border-t-2 border-[#0A0F14] pt-4">
            Deconstructing complex technical problems down to first principles before executing scalable solutions.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Current Exploration Tracks -->
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="font-heading font-black text-2xl uppercase tracking-tight text-[#0A0F14]">
            CURRENT STATUS
          </div>
          
          <div class="space-y-2 font-heading font-black text-lg sm:text-xl uppercase tracking-tight text-[#0A0F14]">
            <div class="py-2.5 px-4 bg-white brutal-border border-[#0A0F14] hover:bg-[#4A9EFF] hover:text-white transition-all duration-200 flex items-center justify-between group cursor-default">
              <span>ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE & ML</span>
              <span class="font-mono-tech text-sm group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">↗</span>
            </div>

            <div class="py-2.5 px-4 bg-white brutal-border border-[#0A0F14] hover:bg-[#54D69A] hover:text-[#0A0F14] transition-all duration-200 flex items-center justify-between group cursor-default">
              <span>AUTOMATION & AI TOOLS</span>
              <span class="font-mono-tech text-sm group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">↗</span>
            </div>

            <div class="py-2.5 px-4 bg-white brutal-border border-[#0A0F14] hover:bg-[#FF6B22] hover:text-white transition-all duration-200 flex items-center justify-between group cursor-default">
              <span>CYBERSECURITY ESSENTIALS</span>
              <span class="font-mono-tech text-sm group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">↗</span>
            </div>

            <div class="py-2.5 px-4 bg-white brutal-border border-[#0A0F14] hover:bg-[#FFD83D] hover:text-[#0A0F14] transition-all duration-200 flex items-center justify-between group cursor-default">
              <span>DIGITAL FINANCE & TECH</span>
              <span class="font-mono-tech text-sm group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">↗</span>
            </div>

            <div class="py-2.5 px-4 bg-white brutal-border border-[#0A0F14] hover:bg-[#DCC5FF] hover:text-[#0A0F14] transition-all duration-200 flex items-center justify-between group cursor-default">
              <span>QUANTUM COMPUTING</span>
              <span class="font-mono-tech text-sm group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">↗</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 03. "I Learn By Doing" & "Beyond Technology" Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      
      <!-- I Learn By Doing -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 brutal-border-thick brutal-shadow-lg space-y-4">
        <h3 class="font-heading font-black text-2xl uppercase text-[#FF6B22]">
          I LEARN BY GETTING INVOLVED
        </h3>
        <p class="font-sans text-sm text-[#0A0F14]/80 leading-relaxed">
          Internships, communities, workshops, hands-on building, and direct client conversations have been the primary ways I've explored technology beyond the classroom.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-2">
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-[#F3F1EB] font-mono-tech text-xs font-bold brutal-border">INTERNSHIPS</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-[#54D69A] font-mono-tech text-xs font-bold brutal-border">GENIUSPHERE</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-[#4A9EFF] text-white font-mono-tech text-xs font-bold brutal-border">WORKSHOPS</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Beyond Technology: 4 Dimensions -->
      <div class="bg-[#54D69A] p-8 brutal-border-thick brutal-shadow-lg space-y-4">
        <h3 class="font-heading font-black text-2xl uppercase text-[#0A0F14]">
          BEYOND TECHNOLOGY
        </h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 font-mono-tech text-xs font-bold">
          <div class="bg-white p-3 brutal-border">
            <span class="text-[#FF6B22] block mb-1">PEOPLE</span>
            <span class="text-[#0A0F14]/80 font-sans text-[11px] block">Community building & student mentoring</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white p-3 brutal-border">
            <span class="text-[#4A9EFF] block mb-1">BUSINESS</span>
            <span class="text-[#0A0F14]/80 font-sans text-[11px] block">Outreach & applied tech-business OS</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white p-3 brutal-border">
            <span class="text-[#54D69A] block mb-1">EDUCATION</span>
            <span class="text-[#0A0F14]/80 font-sans text-[11px] block">Practical AI workshops & skill sharing</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white p-3 brutal-border">
            <span class="text-[#DCC5FF] block mb-1">CURIOSITY</span>
            <span class="text-[#0A0F14]/80 font-sans text-[11px] block">Emerging AI tools & quantum concepts</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>



    <!-- 05. Core Personal Manifesto Banner -->
    <div class="p-8 sm:p-12 bg-[#DCC5FF] text-[#0A0F14] brutal-border-thick brutal-shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
      <blockquote class="font-heading font-black text-2xl sm:text-4xl leading-tight uppercase text-balance">
        "I build technology, businesses, communities, and experiments around problems I find genuinely interesting."
      </blockquote>
      <div class="mt-6 font-mono-tech text-xs text-[#0A0F14]/60 font-bold border-t-2 border-[#0A0F14]/10 pt-4">
        — PAVAN KUMAR, ARCHITECT & BUILDER
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
